OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day. A clear and calm night
OL,7,Fallows mist and fog patches to form
OL,8,Fwidely. Feeling fairly chilly again as
OL,9,Ftemperatures fall to near average for
OL,10,Fthe time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FFog to gradually clear through
OL,13,Fthe morning. Remaining dry but some
OL,14,Fcloud to spill in from the north, then
OL,15,Fbreaking up through the afternoon to
OL,16,Fbring warm sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
