OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FAnother foggy start on Tuesday. Cloud
OL,7,Fand patchy rain on Tuesday, with more
OL,8,Fpersistent wet spells on Wednesday.
OL,9,FDrying up with lower temperatures,
OL,10,Fthereafter.
